	"Name": "Chummy Fix",
	"Author": "ItsLittany",
	"TagLine": "Chummy Fix allows you to fix the odds of a drop appearing in your farm's fish pond(s). You can only produce valid items based on the fish in the pond.",
	"Description": "Chummy Fix allows you to fix the odds of a drop appearing in your farm's fish pond(s). You can only produce valid items based on the fish in the pond.\n\nInstall\n\n1.  [Install the latest version of SMAPI](https://smapi.io).\n\n2.  Download this mod and unzip it into Stardew Valley/Mods.\n\n3.  Run the game using SMAPI.\nUsage\nOnce you have followed the installation steps above and started the game once, you will see a new file in the mod folder called `config.json`. Edit the config file in a text editor like Notepad to change the probability of an item spawning in your Pond's chum bucket. Values are a percentage between 0 and 100.\n\nUpdated to work with the latest release of Stardew!",
